  "prefLabel": "He-C 6438.18 Appeals",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-C 6438.18 Appeals. The adoptive parent may appeal any decision made on eligibility or on a review or termination of the subsidy through the department’s hearings process, as described in He-C 200.\n\nSource. #8837, eff 3-8-07, EXPIRED: 3-8-15",
